crust-seed is a rewrite of cross-seed in Rust. Its matching logic, option
names, CLI surface and HTTP API are ported from that project, and its React
web UI is vendored from it under `web/` — restyled and rebranded, but built
on the same components.

Files derived from cross-seed have been modified. See the git history for the
specific changes.
